flowchart TB
    A["A: Objective -- Build a sustainable business"]
    B["B: Stay true to expertise -- Sell what I know deeply: VSM, flow, Kanban, DevOps"]
    C["C: Meet market demand -- Sell what buyers are actually searching for and willing to pay for"]
    D["D: Position as VSM/flow expert -- Lead with the method. Brand = VSM specialist."]
    Dprime["D': Repackage around felt pain -- Lead with the outcome. Method stays invisible."]

    A --> B
