    subgraph assumptions ["Hidden assumptions to challenge"]
        H1["B-D: To sell VSM, I must lead with the term VSM"]
        H1a["You can apply VSM without ever using the word"]
        H2["B-D: My credibility requires being known as a VSM specialist"]
        H2a["Credibility comes from solving problems, not method branding"]
        H3["C-D': Meeting market demand means abandoning my expertise"]
        H3a["A doctor who says 'I treat chest pain' hasn't abandoned cardiology"]
    end

    subgraph injection ["Injection (breaks the cloud)"]
        I1["Lead with the pain AI creates:"]
        I2["More WIP, bottlenecks absorbing gains, no ROI from AI spend"]
        I3["Use VSM/flow as the delivery mechanism -- not the headline"]
    end

    WARNING{{"This injection is UNVALIDATED -- it's a hypothesis to test"}}

    Dprime -.-> injection
    injection --> WARNING

